---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="DivorceLele | Smart AI Divorce Assistant">
  <div class="bg-[#FBF9F5] min-h-screen">

    <section class="pt-24 pb-16 md:pt-32 md:pb-24 px-5 text-center max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <h1 class="font-serif text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl text-slate-900 mb-6 leading-[1.1]">
        Your strategic advantage in family court
      </h1>
      <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-slate-600 mb-10 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
        A privacy-focused AI assistant trained on thousands of public case hearings. Secure fair support, protect your hard-earned assets, and eliminate hourly retainer anxiety.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-center gap-3">
        <a href="/assistant" class="px-6 py-3 bg-slate-900 text-white text-sm font-semibold rounded-lg hover:bg-slate-800 transition-colors focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-slate-900">
          Try the assistant
        </a>
        <a href="/pricing" class="px-6 py-3 bg-white text-slate-900 text-sm font-semibold rounded-lg border border-slate-300 hover:bg-slate-50 transition-colors focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-slate-900">
          View pricing
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="px-5 pb-16 sm:pb-24">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <div class="bg-slate-900 rounded-2xl aspect-video overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-slate-200 flex items-center justify-center relative group cursor-pointer">
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-slate-800 flex items-center justify-center">
            <span class="text-slate-500 font-medium">Video Player Placeholder</span>
          </div>
          
          <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-white text-slate-900 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center shadow-lg transform group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform relative z-10">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 ml-1" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M8 5v14l11-7z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <div class="absolute bottom-6 left-6 right-6 text-white text-center z-10 pointer-events-none">
            <p class="font-medium drop-shadow-md">See how it works in 2 minutes</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="features" class="py-20 sm:py-28 px-5 border-t border-slate-200">
      <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">

        <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-16">
          <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl md:text-4xl text-slate-900 mb-4">
            Strategic tools for complex proceedings
          </h2>
          <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
            Your pocket-sized second layer of defense, from initial planning to final settlement — without the legal jargon.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6 lg:gap-5">

          <div class="bg-white p-8 md:p-9 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 flex flex-col">
            <div class="w-11 h-11 bg-slate-50 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-slate-900" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 15v2m-6 4h12a2 2 0 002-2v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2zm10-10V7a4 4 0 00-8 0v2" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-serif text-xl text-slate-900 mb-4">Evidence & asset vault</h3>
            <ul class="divide-y divide-slate-100 text-sm text-slate-600 flex-grow">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3 py-3 first:pt-0">
                <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-slate-400 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg>
                <span>Tag and organize toxic WhatsApp chats into structured court annexures.</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3 py-3">
                <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-slate-400 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg>
                <span>Format digital logs to strictly fulfill Section 63 BSA criteria.</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3 py-3">
                <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-slate-400 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg>
                <span>Build itemized Stridhan and asset recovery schedules.</span>
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-white p-8 md:p-9 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 flex flex-col">
            <div class="w-11 h-11 bg-slate-50 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-slate-900" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12h6m-6 4h6m2 5H7a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h5.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l5.414 5.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V19a2 2 0 01-2 2z" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-serif text-xl text-slate-900 mb-4">Statutory disclosures</h3>
            <ul class="divide-y divide-slate-100 text-sm text-slate-600 flex-grow">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3 py-3 first:pt-0">
                <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-slate-400 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg>
                <span>Auto-format complex financial affidavits accurately.</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3 py-3">
                <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-slate-400 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg>
                <span>Comply with Supreme Court mandatory templates (Rajnesh v. Neha).</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3 py-3">
                <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-slate-400 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg>
                <span>Instantly translate and break down opposing counsel legal notices.</span>
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-white p-8 md:p-9 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 flex flex-col">
            <div class="w-11 h-11 bg-slate-50 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-slate-900" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="8" />
                <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4" />
                <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="0.5" fill="currentColor" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-serif text-xl text-slate-900 mb-4">Trial & prep strategy</h3>
            <ul class="divide-y divide-slate-100 text-sm text-slate-600 flex-grow">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3 py-3 first:pt-0">
                <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-slate-400 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg>
                <span>Rehearse hostile questions privately with AI mock cross-examinations.</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3 py-3">
                <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-slate-400 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg>
                <span>Convert years of complex history into a fact-checked marital timeline.</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3 py-3">
                <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-slate-400 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg>
                <span>Structure strategic filings with pinpoint AI accuracy.</span>
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="reviews" class="py-20 sm:py-28 px-5 border-t border-slate-200 bg-white">
      <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
        <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-16">
          <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl md:text-4xl text-slate-900 mb-4">
            Trusted by people in your shoes
          </h2>
          <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
            Real outcomes from users navigating family court. Identities are protected for absolute privacy.
          </p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
          <div class="bg-slate-50 p-8 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200">
            <div class="flex gap-1 mb-5 text-slate-800">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 fill-current" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="M9.049 2.927c.3-.921 1.603-.921 1.902 0l1.07 3.292a1 1 0 00.95.69h3.462c.969 0 1.371 1.24.588 1.81l-2.8 2.034a1 1 0 00-.364 1.118l1.07 3.292c.3.921-.755 1.688-1.54 1.118l-2.8-2.034a1 1 0 00-1.175 0l-2.8 2.034c-.784.57-1.838-.197-1.539-1.118l1.07-3.292a1 1 0 00-.364-1.118L2.98 8.72c-.783-.57-.38-1.81.588-1.81h3.461a1 1 0 00.951-.69l1.07-3.292z"/></svg>
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 fill-current" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="M9.049 2.927c.3-.921 1.603-.921 1.902 0l1.07 3.292a1 1 0 00.95.69h3.462c.969 0 1.371 1.24.588 1.81l-2.8 2.034a1 1 0 00-.364 1.118l1.07 3.292c.3.921-.755 1.688-1.54 1.118l-2.8-2.034a1 1 0 00-1.175 0l-2.8 2.034c-.784.57-1.838-.197-1.539-1.118l1.07-3.292a1 1 0 00-.364-1.118L2.98 8.72c-.783-.57-.38-1.81.588-1.81h3.461a1 1 0 00.951-.69l1.07-3.292z"/></svg>
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 fill-current" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="M9.049 2.927c.3-.921 1.603-.921 1.902 0l1.07 3.292a1 1 0 00.95.69h3.462c.969 0 1.371 1.24.588 1.81l-2.8 2.034a1 1 0 00-.364 1.118l1.07 3.292c.3.921-.755 1.688-1.54 1.118l-2.8-2.034a1 1 0 00-1.175 0l-2.8 2.034c-.784.57-1.838-.197-1.539-1.118l1.07-3.292a1 1 0 00-.364-1.118L2.98 8.72c-.783-.57-.38-1.81.588-1.81h3.461a1 1 0 00.951-.69l1.07-3.292z"/></svg>
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 fill-current" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="M9.049 2.927c.3-.921 1.603-.921 1.902 0l1.07 3.292a1 1 0 00.95.69h3.462c.969 0 1.371 1.24.588 1.81l-2.8 2.034a1 1 0 00-.364 1.118l1.07 3.292c.3.921-.755 1.688-1.54 1.118l-2.8-2.034a1 1 0 00-1.175 0l-2.8 2.034c-.784.57-1.838-.197-1.539-1.118l1.07-3.292a1 1 0 00-.364-1.118L2.98 8.72c-.783-.57-.38-1.81.588-1.81h3.461a1 1 0 00.951-.69l1.07-3.292z"/></svg>
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 fill-current" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="M9.049 2.927c.3-.921 1.603-.921 1.902 0l1.07 3.292a1 1 0 00.95.69h3.462c.969 0 1.371 1.24.588 1.81l-2.8 2.034a1 1 0 00-.364 1.118l1.07 3.292c.3.921-.755 1.688-1.54 1.118l-2.8-2.034a1 1 0 00-1.175 0l-2.8 2.034c-.784.57-1.838-.197-1.539-1.118l1.07-3.292a1 1 0 00-.364-1.118L2.98 8.72c-.783-.57-.38-1.81.588-1.81h3.461a1 1 0 00.951-.69l1.07-3.292z"/></svg>
            </div>
            <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6 italic">
              "I was paying my lawyer a fortune just to read through toxic WhatsApp chats. The assistant categorized everything into neat annexures in seconds. Paid for itself instantly."
            </p>
            <p class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-900">— R., Delhi</p>
          </div>
          
          <div class="bg-slate-50 p-8 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200">
            <div class="flex gap-1 mb-5 text-slate-800">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 fill-current" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="M9.049 2.927c.3-.921 1.603-.921 1.902 0l1.07 3.292a1 1 0 00.95.69h3.462c.969 0 1.371 1.24.588 1.81l-2.8 2.034a1 1 0 00-.364 1.118l1.07 3.292c.3.921-.755 1.688-1.54 1.118l-2.8-2.034a1 1 0 00-1.175 0l-2.8 2.034c-.784.57-1.838-.197-1.539-1.118l1.07-3.292a1 1 0 00-.364-1.118L2.98 8.72c-.783-.57-.38-1.81.588-1.81h3.461a1 1 0 00.951-.69l1.07-3.292z"/></svg>
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 fill-current" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="M9.049 2.927c.3-.921 1.603-.921 1.902 0l1.07 3.292a1 1 0 00.95.69h3.462c.969 0 1.371 1.24.588 1.81l-2.8 2.034a1 1 0 00-.364 1.118l1.07 3.292c.3.921-.755 1.688-1.54 1.118l-2.8-2.034a1 1 0 00-1.175 0l-2.8 2.034c-.784.57-1.838-.197-1.539-1.118l1.07-3.292a1 1 0 00-.364-1.118L2.98 8.72c-.783-.57-.38-1.81.588-1.81h3.461a1 1 0 00.951-.69l1.07-3.292z"/></svg>
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 fill-current" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="M9.049 2.927c.3-.921 1.603-.921 1.902 0l1.07 3.292a1 1 0 00.95.69h3.462c.969 0 1.371 1.24.588 1.81l-2.8 2.034a1 1 0 00-.364 1.118l1.07 3.292c.3.921-.755 1.688-1.54 1.118l-2.8-2.034a1 1 0 00-1.175 0l-2.8 2.034c-.784.57-1.838-.197-1.539-1.118l1.07-3.292a1 1 0 00-.364-1.118L2.98 8.72c-.783-.57-.38-1.81.588-1.81h3.461a1 1 0 00.951-.69l1.07-3.292z"/></svg>
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 fill-current" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="M9.049 2.927c.3-.921 1.603-.921 1.902 0l1.07 3.292a1 1 0 00.95.69h3.462c.969 0 1.371 1.24.588 1.81l-2.8 2.034a1 1 0 00-.364 1.118l1.07 3.292c.3.921-.755 1.688-1.54 1.118l-2.8-2.034a1 1 0 00-1.175 0l-2.8 2.034c-.784.57-1.838-.197-1.539-1.118l1.07-3.292a1 1 0 00-.364-1.118L2.98 8.72c-.783-.57-.38-1.81.588-1.81h3.461a1 1 0 00.951-.69l1.07-3.292z"/></svg>
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 fill-current" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="M9.049 2.927c.3-.921 1.603-.921 1.902 0l1.07 3.292a1 1 0 00.95.69h3.462c.969 0 1.371 1.24.588 1.81l-2.8 2.034a1 1 0 00-.364 1.118l1.07 3.292c.3.921-.755 1.688-1.54 1.118l-2.8-2.034a1 1 0 00-1.175 0l-2.8 2.034c-.784.57-1.838-.197-1.539-1.118l1.07-3.292a1 1 0 00-.364-1.118L2.98 8.72c-.783-.57-.38-1.81.588-1.81h3.461a1 1 0 00.951-.69l1.07-3.292z"/></svg>
            </div>
            <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6 italic">
              "The mock cross-examination tool helped me stay calm. Practicing the hostile questions privately meant I didn't lose my temper in actual mediation."
            </p>
            <p class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-900">— S., Mumbai</p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-slate-50 p-8 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200">
            <div class="flex gap-1 mb-5 text-slate-800">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 fill-current" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="M9.049 2.927c.3-.921 1.603-.921 1.902 0l1.07 3.292a1 1 0 00.95.69h3.462c.969 0 1.371 1.24.588 1.81l-2.8 2.034a1 1 0 00-.364 1.118l1.07 3.292c.3.921-.755 1.688-1.54 1.118l-2.8-2.034a1 1 0 00-1.175 0l-2.8 2.034c-.784.57-1.838-.197-1.539-1.118l1.07-3.292a1 1 0 00-.364-1.118L2.98 8.72c-.783-.57-.38-1.81.588-1.81h3.461a1 1 0 00.951-.69l1.07-3.292z"/></svg>
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 fill-current" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="M9.049 2.927c.3-.921 1.603-.921 1.902 0l1.07 3.292a1 1 0 00.95.69h3.462c.969 0 1.371 1.24.588 1.81l-2.8 2.034a1 1 0 00-.364 1.118l1.07 3.292c.3.921-.755 1.688-1.54 1.118l-2.8-2.034a1 1 0 00-1.175 0l-2.8 2.034c-.784.57-1.838-.197-1.539-1.118l1.07-3.292a1 1 0 00-.364-1.118L2.98 8.72c-.783-.57-.38-1.81.588-1.81h3.461a1 1 0 00.951-.69l1.07-3.292z"/></svg>
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 fill-current" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="M9.049 2.927c.3-.921 1.603-.921 1.902 0l1.07 3.292a1 1 0 00.95.69h3.462c.969 0 1.371 1.24.588 1.81l-2.8 2.034a1 1 0 00-.364 1.118l1.07 3.292c.3.921-.755 1.688-1.54 1.118l-2.8-2.034a1 1 0 00-1.175 0l-2.8 2.034c-.784.57-1.838-.197-1.539-1.118l1.07-3.292a1 1 0 00-.364-1.118L2.98 8.72c-.783-.57-.38-1.81.588-1.81h3.461a1 1 0 00.951-.69l1.07-3.292z"/></svg>
