              <svg class="w-4 h-4 fill-current" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="M9.049 2.927c.3-.921 1.603-.921 1.902 0l1.07 3.292a1 1 0 00.95.69h3.462c.969 0 1.371 1.24.588 1.81l-2.8 2.034a1 1 0 00-.364 1.118l1.07 3.292c.3.921-.755 1.688-1.54 1.118l-2.8-2.034a1 1 0 00-1.175 0l-2.8 2.034c-.784.57-1.838-.197-1.539-1.118l1.07-3.292a1 1 0 00-.364-1.118L2.98 8.72c-.783-.57-.38-1.81.588-1.81h3.461a1 1 0 00.951-.69l1.07-3.292z"/></svg>
            </div>
            <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6 italic">
              "Formatting my financial affidavit accurately felt impossible until I used this. It perfectly matched the Supreme Court templates my lawyer required."
            </p>
            <p class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-900">— A., Bengaluru</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="faq" class="py-20 sm:py-28 px-5 border-t border-slate-200">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        <div class="text-center mb-16">
          <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl md:text-4xl text-slate-900 mb-4">
            Common questions
          </h2>
          <p class="text-lg text-slate-600">
            Clear answers about privacy, legality, and how the assistant works.
          </p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <details class="group bg-white p-6 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 cursor-pointer [&_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden shadow-sm">
            <summary class="flex justify-between items-center font-medium text-slate-900">
              <span>Is my case data and evidence kept private?</span>
              <span class="transition duration-300 group-open:-rotate-180 text-slate-400">
                <svg fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"></path></svg>
              </span>
            </summary>
            <p class="text-slate-600 mt-4 leading-relaxed text-sm">
              Absolutely. We use end-to-end encryption and do not train our AI models on your personal case data. Your evidence vault remains strictly confidential, and you can securely wipe your data from our servers at any time.
            </p>
          </details>

          <details class="group bg-white p-6 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 cursor-pointer [&_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden shadow-sm">
            <summary class="flex justify-between items-center font-medium text-slate-900">
              <span>Will this replace my lawyer?</span>
              <span class="transition duration-300 group-open:-rotate-180 text-slate-400">
                <svg fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"></path></svg>
              </span>
            </summary>
            <p class="text-slate-600 mt-4 leading-relaxed text-sm">
              No. DivorceLele is designed to make you the most prepared client your lawyer has ever had. By organizing your own timelines, evidence, and financial disclosures, you drastically reduce the billable hours your lawyer spends on administrative work, saving you money for actual legal strategy.
            </p>
          </details>

